#. i18n: /home/martin/xtrackcad/src/gtk3/app/lib/demos/dmgroup.xtr:282
#: ../../build/app/i18n/custmsg.h:577
msgid ""
"Notice that the name has changed to indicate the turnout was Ungrouped.\n"
